The files were fetched from fonts.gstatic.com by tools/vendor.sh and renamed to
fNN.woff2. Google's own basenames run to more than 200 characters for variable
fonts, which is hostile to tooling and to a repository.

The CSS in fonts.css is Google's, with every absolute URL rewritten to a local
sibling file. No request leaves this machine at runtime.
